    "market_commentary": "A 314-point increase from 11 April lifted the SSY Pacific Capesize Index to 7,017, although it remains below the year-ago level. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate climbed $0.50/t to $9.75/t, while there was a $4,750/day rise in the round-voyage rate to $15,000/day.",
